msgid "Number of ancestors"
msgstr "祖先の数"

msgid "Shows the number of ancestors of the current person"
msgstr "現在の人物の祖先の数を表示します"

#, python-format
msgid "Number of %s's ancestors"
msgstr "%s の祖先の数"

msgid "Generation"
msgstr "世代"

msgid "Found"
msgstr "見つかった"

msgid "Theoretical"
msgstr "理論値"

msgid "Percent"
msgstr "割合"

msgid ""
"There were {} of {} ancestors ({}) found.\n"
"Only individual ancestors were counted. Duplicates caused by pedigree "
"collapse were ignored."
msgstr ""
"{} 人の祖先のうち {} 人 ({}%）が見つかりました。\n"
"個人の祖先のみがカウントされました。家系崩壊による重複は無視されました。"
